    "subject": "Penny",
    "teaser": "",
    "entry": "The Skinner appeared as a corpse-like body with no skin. It showed resistance to small arms fire, but dissolved through skin-to-skin contact.",
    "notes": "The Skinner operated out of The Hoaxatorium. The aberration ingratiated itself with the Subject, Penny, with the two seeming to form a symbiotic relationship of mutual protection. The aberration arrived with a shipment of Ancient Egyptian coffins, which is where the Aberration and Subject first made contact. The Subject showed kindness to the Aberration and in return, the Aberration would kill those that were mean to the Subject. Before killing, the Aberration would begin to sing and remove the skin from the target.",
